			"notes": "## Kill Confirmed 1.1.0\n\n- Fix dog tag registration on Minecraft 26.x.\n- Fix missing datapack-provided information when a command function causes a player's death, including nested provider functions.\n- Share gameplay and snapshot serialization across the existing Minecraft versions through RinLib.\n- Simplify pending-tag delivery while preserving existing dog tags, saved pending tags, item IDs and configuration.\n\nRequires RinLib 1.1.0 or newer. Fabric also requires Fabric API.\n\nValidated on Minecraft 1.21.1, 26.1.2 and 26.2 with Fabric and NeoForge: 564 server assertions, six client startup checks and 10 unit tests. Existing 1.0.1 dog tag data was checked on all supported versions."
		},
